[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   step_126: Ten-channel global cross-survey and multi-lineage synthesis.
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   This step aggregates ten overlapping observational summaries across six
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   distinct catalogue lineages and multiple dynamical populations, all testing
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   convergence on the declared outer solar system proper-time domain boundary:
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   Resident population channels (identical per-axis in-cap Rayleigh
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   machinery on each survey's own per-object elements):
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   C1: SBDB secure detached TNOs (a>150, q>30, cc<=3, N=44) -- varpi clustering
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   C2: DES Y6 detached TNOs (Bernardinelli et al. 2022, N=16) -- independent survey/fit
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   C3: MPCORB census detached TNOs (MPC lineage, N=63) -- independent catalogue
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   C4: MPCORB distant belt mean-plane lean azimuth (80-400 AU non-resonant)
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   Cometary transit & spatial channels:
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   C5: CODE comets orig->fut rotation without energy exchange (N=131, class-1)
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   C6: Warsaw comets inbound-leg rotation discrepancy (N=98, near-parabolic)
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   C7: One-apparition comets uncertainty-normalized rotation (N=30)
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   C8: MPC CometEls census near-parabolic aphelion dipole (fragment-merged census, as step_108)
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   C9: SBDB post-2017 prospective comets aphelion dipole (N=287, 2018-2026)
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   Inflow / Outflow bipolar channel:
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   C10: Jupiter-family comets (JFCs) antipodal perihelion concentration (N=378)
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   A 20,000-draw random-axis comparison evaluates a conditional sky-area rank: the fraction of random sky directions whose joint Fisher statistic
[2026-09-20 12:42:08 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 126]   S = -2 sum ln p reaches or exceeds the value measured at the declared boundary axis.
